      "content": "It's not uncommon for people who feel deeply attuned to the energy shifts to believe they'll receive messages from beyond the physical realm. Here are some healthy practices to help help distinguish potentially meaningful signs from mere thoughts:\n\n1. Recognize patterns: Keep an open mind, but approach the experiences with skepticism. Record any unusual experiences or signs for later analysis. Look for repeating motifs or themes that aren't easily explained by your usual thoughts and surroundings.\n\n2. Share your experiences: Discussing your experiences with trusted friends or members of a spiritual community can help you gain an outsider's perspective and may help you identify whether it's consistent with your own observations or just echoes of preexisting thoughts.\n\n3. Stay grounded: Continue to engage in regular, grounding activities like meditation and journaling to help differentiate between everyday mental processes and any potential unusual experiences.\n\n4. Check your mental state: Sometimes, physical or mental stress can manifest as spiritual experiences. Ensure you're taking care of your basic needs and speaking with a mental health professional if you're concerned about the impact of these thoughts on your overall wellbeing.\n\nIf you truly feel that something significant is happening, it's perfectly natural to seek further guidance and validation from your chosen spiritual community. As always, assessing these experiences with both an open and critical mind",
